<title>FRANCE: EU agrees French wheat aid for Ethiopia, Eritrea.</title>
<headline>EU agrees French wheat aid for Ethiopia, Eritrea.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union has agreed the supply of 6,000 tonnes of French soft wheat to Ethiopia and of a further 4,000 tonnes to Eritrea as food aid, EU grain industry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The EU also agreed the supply of 5,840 tonnes of French soft wheat flour to Yemen as food aid.</p>
<p>Both the soft wheat and the flour are for shipment in November.</p>
<p>The EU's grain committee took the decision at its weekly meeting on Thursday.</p>
</text>
